# The Ravager, the command deck (TSL, 222TEL, 851NIH): Mandalore's last
# word at the shuttle on Citadel Station (222mand start 1: "Let's go."),
# the boarding (the shuttle's MalMov04, Mandalore and Zuka's
# breach scene, 851mand, and Visas with Mandalore, 851visas); four proton
# core sites mined with Zuka on the comlink (851dem, a site at each
# tr_851dem trigger), in DSimpson's order: bomb site 1 (south-west), bomb
# site 2 (the lower hallway's dead end), Colonel Tobin in his room (no
# Persuade: fought), the "fourth" site north of Tobin as the third core,
# whose reply fires the premature detonation (851exp: one core lost, a new
# one owed from the missile bay); Visas's cell (851visdr: she meditates
# once more, 851medit), and on to the bridge's door.
# Starts from the finale's checkpoint (drafted by another agent):
#   kjk playthrough tsl @finale_done data/routes/tsl/ravager_command_deck.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Ravager" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/,
# gamefaqs/dsimpson_faq_walkthrough_v1.6.txt [TRVGR]); GameBanshee 57.
# Left: the lockers (Locker_Nihlus) and the DC 55 security doors' rooms
# (door_nih003, locked), the workbench; the missile bay is the next routes'
# (after Nihilus, as DSimpson does it).
#
# ASSUMES:
#   @finale_done stands in 222TEL with the fuel saboteurs dead, away from
#   tr_mandalore (finale_citadel.route): 222mand's start 0 already answered
#   there ("I'm not ready yet", Visas told to stay close, a_set_party), so
#   tr_mandalore now opens start 1. # UNSURE: if the finale's run ends
#   elsewhere (inside 851NIH), the `if in 222tel` block is skipped, its say
#   inside it never queued.
#   The party aboard is Mandalore (NPC 2) and Visas (NPC 9), as a_set_party
#   and the finale's `party 9` left it.
#   Revan was a man and light (101PER_Revan_End 0: the escape goes by
#   Carth on 205TEL, the escape route).
#   No Persuade for Tobin (851tobin R48/R49 need c_sc_per_gt): he is fought;
#   Kerbow: no alignment change, Mandalore +INF.
# Says are queued and taken by the next offer that has them, so each sits
# before the goal that starts its conversation.
if in 222tel
say Let's go.        # 222mand start 1 ("Are your preparations complete?"):
to tr_mandalore      # a_playmovie, a_to851: MalMov04 (by TO_851NIH)
talk                 # # UNSURE: if the trigger fires once only, `use Mand`
end
module 851nih
talk                 # the breach (RavagerIntro's 851mand, from OnEnter)
talk                 # Visas and Mandalore (851visas). # UNSURE: who starts it
fight 30             # the boarding hall's Sith
# Bomb site 1, down the western corridor (mn_bomb1).
say Set one of the proton cores # 851dem start 1: E1, then E4
say Hold your position, and we'll set the rest of the charges.
to tr_851dem@1
talk
fight 30
# Bomb site 2, the lower hallway's dead end east of the central passage.
say Set one of the proton cores # E6: two sites left
say We'll see about placing the remaining two charges.
to tr_851dem@2
talk
fight 30
# Colonel Tobin in his room (DSimpson: "up through this area").
say You made your choice, Tobin.
say I've heard enough. Prepare to die. # a_hostile
use tobin            # 851tobin. # UNSURE: he may start it as the party nears
fight 30
# The "fourth" bomb site north of Tobin's room (mn_bomb4): the third core.
say Set one of the proton cores # E7: one core left
say Hold on, we're almost done. # a_fire851expdlg: the premature detonation
to tr_851dem@4
talk
talk                 # 851exp: Mandalore and Zuka, one more core owed
fight 30
# Visas's cell door (tr_visas_med) in the lower hallway by the bridge.
say Is there anything you need from your cell? # 851visdr
say Do whatever you feel you need to do. # a_visas_cs1: she walks in
to tr_visas_med
talk
talk                 # her meditation (851medit, tr_visas_med2 as she enters
                     # her chamber). # UNSURE: whether the player must follow
fight 30             # the last room before the bridge
exit TO_852NIH       # the bridge
module 852nih
save ravager_bridge
